{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The faithful El.</b> Steadfast regarding any matter — He does not change." "<b>Who keeps the covenant and repays those who hate Him.</b> The reason a 'wicked man who has it good' obtains is for two causes: the first is the merit of the fathers. The second is some merit found in the wicked man himself — insufficient to earn him life in the World to Come, so He repays him in this world, for the Holy One, blessed be He, does not withhold the reward of any creature."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:20:48.526819296Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}